--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: NatsukiMurdersWitches1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391310
    - rid: 268100066478391311
    - rid: 268100066478391312
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uhh... my feet are killing me...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100066478391313
    - rid: 268100066478391315
    - rid: 268100094052532224
    - rid: 268100094052532225
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Is this where the coven is hiding?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532226
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Should be, the old man's journey said it was a cave down in Falkreath,
      with surroundings exactly like this one.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: You think that these witches will have some sort of tricks up their sleeves?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: Undoubtedly, if they have the power to curse our very blood, who can
      say what else they can do.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (We're probably in over our heads, aren't we...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Bah! Even so, they won't be able to match our strength united.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Strength this, strength that, it won't do you much good if they magically
      turn your pants solid.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532232
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, crap, <i>can</i> they do that-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe. Only one way to find out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532234
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The four enter the cave.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100094052532235
    - rid: 268100094052532236
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The four arrive at a large central chamber, without any sign of the witches
      being present in their cave.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you guys think that the witches might've know we were coming-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785856
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As if on queue, they find themselves surrounded by various harmful magics.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785857
    - rid: 268100115201785858
    - rid: 268100115201785860
    - rid: 268100115201785932
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785861
    - rid: 268100115201785862
    - rid: 268100115201785863
    - rid: 268100115201785864
    - rid: 268100115201785865
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The cowards reveal themselves!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785928
    - rid: 268100115201785929
    - rid: 268100115201785930
    - rid: 268100115201785931
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The group takes stock of the situation, finding themselves surrounded
      by five witches.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Just about one for each of us...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Not to worry, I can take on two.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: After a brief period of assigning the witches among the group, the Companions
      dispurse to fight their witch.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785940
    - rid: 268100115201785939
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785933
    - rid: 268100115201785934
    - rid: 268100115201785935
    - rid: 268100115201785936
    - rid: 268100115201785938
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With the brief reprieve she earned, Natsuki looks around to see how the
      rest of the group is doing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785942
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Farkas and Vilkas seem to be just finishing off their fights, while Aela
      is having a rough time with her fight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785943
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The witch Natsuki's fighting has now recovered and is ready for round
      two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785944
    - rid: 268100135178469483
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100115201785945
    - rid: 268100115201785946
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Phew...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469376
    - rid: 268100135178469377
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Having trouble, Aela?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469378
    - rid: 268100135178469379
    - rid: 268100135178469380
    - rid: 268100135178469381
    - rid: 268100135178469382
    - rid: 268100135178469384
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With everyone else freed from their fights, they surround the two witches
      Aela was fighting-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: As if-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela takes down one of the witches and turns to the one witch remaining.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469492
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Lucky me, I get an audience to bear witness to my glory in battle!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3bfbce50e06cf14e9490ea551e14f87, type: 2}
    dialog: Our coven grants you power beyond mortal means, and this is how you repay
      us?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: We all know that power was granted under false pretenses-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: You should have seen this coming.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3bfbce50e06cf14e9490ea551e14f87, type: 2}
    dialog: I see, well then...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469385
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The final witch gets on her knees and raises her hands while extending
      her arms to the side.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469383
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3bfbce50e06cf14e9490ea551e14f87, type: 2}
    dialog: May the Spirits alleviate me in my hour of need; sending my enemies to
      theirs.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Your prayers won't save you-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela attempts to deal the final blow on the witch, but is whisked away
      to... somewhere by... something...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469386
    - rid: 268100135178469387
    - rid: 268100135178469484
    - rid: 268100135178469488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db46f9c9f9769b944946c389f5c0fbec, type: 2}
    dialog: What have you done-?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17bd3b6fcae930647918fc183fea836b, type: 2}
    dialog: Brother-!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469388
    - rid: 268100135178469485
    - rid: 268100135178469489
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3bfbce50e06cf14e9490ea551e14f87, type: 2}
    dialog: Good riddance.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469389
    - rid: 268100135178469486
    - rid: 268100135178469490
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469390
    - rid: 268100135178469392
    - rid: 268100135178469487
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Where am I-?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you get in here?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469393
    - rid: 268100135178469394
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Eep!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469396
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki has found herself surrounded by some sort of band of ruffians.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469397
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Based on the witch's wording, it's safe to assume that they're Silver
      Hand.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh oh!)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469399
    - rid: 268100135178469398
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's eyes quickly dart around, trying to find an easy exit from
      this situation.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469400
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: She doesn't find one; she's completely surrounded and devoid of Shield-Siblings.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469401
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (C-crap, how am I supposed to...?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469402
    - rid: 268100135178469403
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: A bunch of thoughts run through Natsuki's head, none of them seeming
      to provide an adequate chance of survival-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469404
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (... oh.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469405
    - rid: 268100135178469406
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: It seems that Natsuki came up with something...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: And that something was to use her beast blood, despite her prejudices.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469407
    - rid: 268100135178469408
    - rid: 268100135178469409
    - rid: 268100135178469410
    - rid: 268100135178469411
    - rid: 268100135178469412
    - rid: 268100135178469413
    - rid: 268100135178469414
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: The beast reveals herself!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm the beast? You're the guys who'd murder an innocent 18 year old girl!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469415
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: ... it can talk?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh. I <i>am</i> still in control of myself...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Nice.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268100135178469469
    - rid: 4927988066573615104
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With her lucidity secure, Natsuki unleashes the wrath of a werewolf upon
      the would-be werewolf hunters.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615105
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615106
    - rid: 4927988066573615107
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, immediate problem dealt with...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615108
    - rid: 4927988066573615109
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm clearly in some sort of building, based on the bricks.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (But where...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615110
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki looks around the room, in hopes of finding some sort of clue
      or exit.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Huh. That table's got some weird stuff lying on it...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, are those some pieces of Wuuthrad? They seem to be the same sort
      of dark-black metal...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Guess I'll grab these for now.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615111
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki picks up the few fragments of Wuuthrad.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1d2575c9b40aae842a0e56edb93f9f48, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, get off your lazy bum, a werewolf somehow got in!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh goody...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615166
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Instead of actually fighting them, Natsuki decides to just run forward,
      hopeful that there's a way out in that direction.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615168
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, a door!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (And it seems chillier over here, so that door probably leads outside.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki heads through the door, hopeful to get a better bearing on her
      surroundings once she's outdoors.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615171
    - rid: 4927988066573615174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Where the hell am I?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615172
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: With the immediate danger dealt with, Natsuki reverts back into her human
      form so she can look at her map without tearing it up with her claws.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615175
    - rid: 4927988066573615176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe I should've stayed like that... it's pretty chilly without the
      fur...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki tries to climb up the rock just ahead to see if there's any notable
      landmarks that she can identify on her map.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Okay, there's a lighthouse lookin' thing that way...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (There's a fort-tower-thing that way...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (There's a bunch of snow everywhere and there's mountains in just about
      every direction...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Obviously, I'm pretty far north, but <i>where</i>...?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What time was it when we found the witches?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm pretty sure it was still morning... and we didn't spend much time
      fighting them before we got warped...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (In that case, based on where the sun is, this way should be south.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615180
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki begins heading "south" to get out of the cold as soon as possible-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615181
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Without making sure that the sun rises and sets in the same directions
      as it does in her world.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4927988066573615182
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
